                        SQL Database
                           ----------> RDS in AWS

    AWS = Supports many engines (MySQL, Oracle, MAriadb)
    Azure = focused on SQL server only (Microsoft product)

    SQL server:
    --> It is simply a logical container
    --> It is like container that manages one or more databases
    --> It contains:
    1. sql server login credentials
    2. firewall rules
    3. security settings
    4. databases

    why we need this?
    --> insted of configuring security seperatey for every database, 
    Azure store many settings at the sql server.
    eg: firewall, IAM

                      Azure Function
                           ----------> Lambda in AWS

    --> Azure function is a serverless compute service in Microsoft Azure.
    --> Azure function is used when
    1. you want to run small task automatically
    2. you dont want to manage server
    3. you only oay for the time your code runs.

    